<title>USA: Allegiant Physician CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Allegiant Physician CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allegiant Physician Services Inc said executive vice president and chief financial officer Timothy Powers has resigned effective today.</p>
<p>The company said Powers is pursuing other career opportunities.</p>
<p>Allegiant did not immediately name a successor.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
